Phase 8 – Project Demonstration

1. Project Title
FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

2. Demonstration Objective
The objective of the demonstration is to show the working of the FitBuddy application and explain how Gemini AI is used to generate a personalized fitness plan.

3. Demonstration Flow
Introduce the project.
Explain the problem being addressed.
Explain the main features.
Open the FitBuddy application.
Enter sample fitness information.
Select a fitness goal.
Click Generate Plan.
Show the AI-generated fitness plan.
Explain the generated results.
Demonstrate the regenerate option.
Explain the benefits and future enhancements.

4. Demonstration Requirements
Working FitBuddy application
Computer or laptop
Internet connection
Google Gemini integration
Screen recording software
Microphone for voice-over

5. Demo Video Content
The demo video should include:
Project name: FitBuddy
Purpose: AI-based personalized fitness plan generation
Benefits: Easy and personalized fitness planning
Working process: User input → Gemini AI → Fitness plan
Final output: Generated fitness plan

6. Demo Video Submission
The completed demonstration video will be uploaded to Google Drive with appropriate sharing permissions so that it can be accessed by the faculty.

7. Expected Demonstration Outcome
The demonstration will show that FitBuddy can accept user fitness information and generate a personalized fitness plan using Google Gemini AI.
